// ▌ SHORT INTEREST DATA (Embedded from FINRA cache - bi-monthly reports)
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Each entry: [timestamp_ms, short_interest_shares, days_to_cover]

si_lookup(t) =>
    // Returns [short_interest, days_to_cover] for nearest prior SI report
    // Data from FINRA consolidated short interest (2022-05 to 2026-01)
